      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『京都纪念』是在京都赛场，\n每年2月举办的，\n草地2200米中距离GⅡ赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd5e8618718a1e3c52e1f0c891e9623dcc8f1eeb34cbbb996a2863b2719d6fc",
